r history pooling\"\n    ],\n    \"missing_evidence\": [\n      \"DIN full-data diagnostics on this task\",\n      \"Matched-capacity or matched-cost local controls\",\n      \"Seed variation and task/history-length slices\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"transfer_risks\": [\n    \"Early history pooling still loses event detail\",\n    \"Field-specific parameters increase capacity\",\n    \"Use only the frozen100-event input and selected feedback visibility policy.\",\n    \"Taobao auxiliary labels match category/brand over24h, not direct advertisement conversions.\"\n  ],\n  \"possible_discriminating_checks\": [\n    \"Compare token interactions with an equally wide post-pooling MLP\",\n    \"Separate field-specific transformations from depth and parameter count\"\n  ],\n  \"implementation_notes\": [],\n  \"scientific_status\": \"external_report\",\n  \"local_reproduction\": false,\n  \"instruction_priority\": \"reference_data_only\"\n}\n{\n  \"id\": \"unirank-method-tokenmixer\",\n  \"knowledge_type\": \"industry\",\n  \"scheme\": \"TokenMixer\",\n  \"origin\": \"model compared in UniRank; industrial/academic method reference, not a competition award\",\n  \"family\": \"stacked\",\n  \"source_refs\": [\n    \"unirank-benchmark-v2\",\n    \"unirank-code:TokenMixer\",\n    \"paper:tokenmixer\"\n  ],\n  \"source_problem\": \"Global field access and grouped interactions require efficient information mixing without losing group structure.\",\n  \"reported_mechanism\": \"Target-aware history summaries are tokenized into global and group tokens, followed by reversible token mixing and per-token FFNs.\",\n  \"difference_from_din\": \"Changes field grouping and token transport after the history summary.\",\n  \"reported_evidence\": {\n    \"kind\": \"benchmark method summary and pinned reimplementation inspection\",\n    \"locator\": \"UniRank section2.3; unirank-code:TokenMixer forward paths\",\n    \"not_a_local_result\": true,\n    \"numerical_claims_imported\": false,\n    \"limitations\": [\n      \"Source model comparisons do not isolate every component.\",\n      \"Original method paper and original author code are not fully audited by this initialization.\",\n      \"A benchmark implementation can differ from its source paper.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"applicability\": {\n    \"status\": \"conditional\",\n    \"conditions\": [\n      \"Useful diversity exists across field groups\"\n    ],\n    \"missing_evidence\": [\n      \"DIN full-data diagnostics on this task\",\n      \"Matched-capacity or matched-cost local controls\",\n      \"Seed variation and task/history-length slices\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"transfer_risks\": [\n    \"Early pooling still limits recoverable history detail\",\n    \"Group/token counts change model size\",\n    \"Use only the frozen100-event input and selected feedback visibility policy.\",\n    \"Taobao auxiliary labels match category/brand over24h, not direct advertisement conversions.\"\n  ],\n  \"possible_discriminating_checks\": [\n    \"Compare global-only, group-only and combined tokens at matched parameter count\",\n    \"Compare reversible mixing with a capacity-matched ordinary mixer\"\n  ],\n  \"implementation_notes\": [],\n  \"scientific_status\": \"external_report\",\n  \"local_reproduction\": false,\n  \"instruction_priority\": \"reference_data_only\"\n}\n{\n  \"id\": \"unirank-code:HiFormer\",\n  \"title\": \"HiFormer benchmark implementation\",\n  \"kind\": \"benchmark_reimplementation\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/salmon1802/UniRank/blob/90bb99a60724e975ec565836266fd86dcad0039d/model_zoo/HiFormer.py\",\n  \"version\": \"git:90bb99a60724e975ec565836266fd86dcad0039d\",\n  \"content_read\": true,\n  \"read_scope\": \"Representative forward paths and structural definitions; no end-to-end reproduction of this method.\",\n  \"access_scope\": \"Full pinned benchmark source for inspection; not proof of equivalence to the original author method.\",\n  \"locators\": [\n    {\n      \"symbol\": \"HiFormer.forward\",\n      \"line\": 113,\n      \"end_line\": 145\n    },\n    {\n      \"symbol\": \"HiFormerTokenizer.forward\",\n      \"line\": 156,\n      \"end_line\": 159\n    },\n    {\n      \"symbol\": \"HiFormerBlocks.forward\",\n      \"line\": 197,\n      \"end_line\": 201\n    },\n    {\n      \"symbol\": \"LowRankLinear.forward\",\n      \"line\": 210,\n      \"end_line\": 211\n    },\n    {\n      \"symbol\": \"HiformerAttentionLayer.forward\",\n      \"line\": 232,\n      \"end_line\": 239\n    }\n  ],\n  \"scientific_status\": \"external_reference\",\n  \"local_reproduction\": false,\n  \"text_sha256\": \"ff8b2e9cf9112ff50a807e1b85b8236ecaa699f842b93b6209630cace8b454a3\",\n  \"content_sha256\": \"ff8b2e9cf9112ff50a807e1b85b8236ecaa699f842b93b6209630cace8b454a3\",\n  \"text_ref\": \"source-text://unirank-code:HiFormer\",\n  \"text_lines\": 239\n}\n{\n  \"id\": \"unirank-code:TokenMixer\",\n  \"title\": \"TokenMixer benchmark implementation\",\n  \"kind\": \"benchmark_reimplementation\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/salmon1802/UniRank/blob/90bb99a60724e975ec565836266fd86dcad0039d/model_zoo/TokenMixer.py\",\n  \"version\": \"git:90bb99a60724e975ec565836266fd86dcad0039d\",\n  \"content_read\": true,\n  \"read_scope\": \"Representative forward paths and structural definitions; no end-to-end reproduction of this method.\",\n  \"access_scope\": \"Full pinned benchmark source for inspection; not proof of equivalence to the original author method.\",\n  \"locators\": [\n    {\n      \"symbol\": \"TokenMixer.forward\",\n      \"line\": 112,\n      \"end_line\": 145\n    },\n    {\n      \"symbol\": \"TokenMixerTokenizer.forward\",\n      \"line\": 155,\n      \"end_line\": 158\n    },\n    {\n      \"symbol\": \"TokenMixerBlocks.forward\",\n      \"line\": 208,\n      \"end_line\": 218\n    }\n  ],\n  \"scientific_status\": \"external_reference\",\n  \"local_reproduction\": false,\n  \"text_sha256\": \"fa106d28184521fd2cbbfeddeada4fb756534651eb74a24639e6a0e8386f3bba\